        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATOMANTA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458340/extras/c5d8395988318dfc1dbf3a32fb74ce79.poster.avif?t=1759085805\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458340/extras/c5d8395988318dfc1dbf3a32fb74ce79.webm?t=1759085805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458340/extras/c5d8395988318dfc1dbf3a32fb74ce79.mp4?t=1759085805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >●Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of Taria Takara, a space pirate on a mission to recover a highly valuable artifact hidden on the planet Azavuraz. Armed with the powerful Atomic Manta warship, Taria finally has a chance to claim the bounty and pay off the debts from her previous handlers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atomanta is a retro-styled vertical shoot em-up inspired by various Mega Drive and arcade titles from the '90s. Atomanta strives to combine the old-school visuals of pixel art with a more modern approach of a faster bullet hell experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atomanta may be designed to bring a nostalgic journey, but there's also a ranking system that encourages a more aggressive play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458340/extras/6940f19d1525f8002c491ef1358345eb.poster.avif?t=1759085805\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458340/extras/6940f19d1525f8002c491ef1358345eb.webm?t=1759085805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458340/extras/6940f19d1525f8002c491ef1358345eb.mp4?t=1759085805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >●Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 8 unique stages!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick between 3 different starting loadouts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover up to 15 secret weapons and 4 alternate paths.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy beautifully crafted retro pixel art and upbeat synth tunes!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with hard mode, or uncover the hidden hyper mode.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a ranking system that encourages honing your skill.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >●Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose between three starter weapons at the beginning of the run and can upgrade them up to 3 times with power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons can be swapped via special options to change playstyle, set to max power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player has a small glowing hitbox to make dodging easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player ship does not lose power-ups when it is destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus mode is attached to the rail gun, using a laser sight to help line up shots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs  cancel bullets and deal massive damage across the screen, and their damage can be upgraded with secret pickup options, but it doesn't carry over between stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship speed and mobility are gradually faster depending on the difficulty </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(higher difficulty, more speed and mobility)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >●Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The trailer is not a complete representation of the final product, so expect enemy placements and details in stages may be slightly different on release. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Supports Xbox, PlayStation, keyboard, and third-party controllers, but mainly focuses on Xbox controller users. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has been made with the power of SHMUP Creator! An incredible tool for creating Shoot 'Em Up genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'd like to thank the community and everyone who has been involved in helping me to make this game a reality! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >●Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to RAIT Studio for creating such amazing cover art and character design for the protagonist and to Falah for bringing the character avatar to life in-game. Lastly, I'd like to thank Kaitlyn Walker for providing her awesome voice for the project!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATOMANTA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458340/extras/c5d8395988318dfc1dbf3a32fb74ce79.poster.avif?t=1759085805\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458340/extras/c5d8395988318dfc1dbf3a32fb74ce79.webm?t=1759085805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458340/extras/c5d8395988318dfc1dbf3a32fb74ce79.mp4?t=1759085805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >●Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of Taria Takara, a space pirate on a mission to recover a highly valuable artifact hidden on the planet Azavuraz. Armed with the powerful Atomic Manta warship, Taria finally has a chance to claim the bounty and pay off the debts from her previous handlers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atomanta is a retro-styled vertical shoot em-up inspired by various Mega Drive and arcade titles from the '90s. Atomanta strives to combine the old-school visuals of pixel art with a more modern approach of a faster bullet hell experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atomanta may be designed to bring a nostalgic journey, but there's also a ranking system that encourages a more aggressive play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458340/extras/6940f19d1525f8002c491ef1358345eb.poster.avif?t=1759085805\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458340/extras/6940f19d1525f8002c491ef1358345eb.webm?t=1759085805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458340/extras/6940f19d1525f8002c491ef1358345eb.mp4?t=1759085805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >●Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 8 unique stages!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick between 3 different starting loadouts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover up to 15 secret weapons and 4 alternate paths.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy beautifully crafted retro pixel art and upbeat synth tunes!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with hard mode, or uncover the hidden hyper mode.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a ranking system that encourages honing your skill.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >●Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose between three starter weapons at the beginning of the run and can upgrade them up to 3 times with power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons can be swapped via special options to change playstyle, set to max power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player has a small glowing hitbox to make dodging easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player ship does not lose power-ups when it is destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus mode is attached to the rail gun, using a laser sight to help line up shots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombs  cancel bullets and deal massive damage across the screen, and their damage can be upgraded with secret pickup options, but it doesn't carry over between stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship speed and mobility are gradually faster depending on the difficulty </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(higher difficulty, more speed and mobility)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >●Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The trailer is not a complete representation of the final product, so expect enemy placements and details in stages may be slightly different on release. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Supports Xbox, PlayStation, keyboard, and third-party controllers, but mainly focuses on Xbox controller users. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has been made with the power of SHMUP Creator! An incredible tool for creating Shoot 'Em Up genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'd like to thank the community and everyone who has been involved in helping me to make this game a reality! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >●Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to RAIT Studio for creating such amazing cover art and character design for the protagonist and to Falah for bringing the character avatar to life in-game. Lastly, I'd like to thank Kaitlyn Walker for providing her awesome voice for the project!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></p>",
        "short_description": "Atomanta is a sci-fi retro-styled vertical shoot 'em-up inspired by various Mega Drive and arcade titles from the '90s, by combining the old-school visuals of pixel art with a more modern approach of a faster bullet hell experience, smaller hitbox, and a bunch of weapons to fight off enemy forces.",
